OL,3,ATwo teenagers, 13 and 14, among 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing in Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the UK
OL,7,Fhas offered #5m to help the Nepalese
OL,8,Fgovernment following the floods, saying
OL,9,Fit was a "very distressing and
OL,10,Fdevastating situation".
OL,12,FThe King said he and the Queen were
OL,13,F"heartbroken" and sent their "most
OL,14,Fprofound sympathy" to those affected.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
