OL,3,ANumber of asylum seekers in hotels
OL,4,Ahalves in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a significant fall in
OL,7,Fthe use of hotels to house asylum
OL,8,Fseekers waiting for a Home Office
OL,9,Fdecision, data shows.
OL,11,FIn June 2025 there were more than
OL,12,F32,000 people in hotel rooms, but by
OL,13,FJune this year it had halved to more
OL,14,Fthan 16,000.
OL,16,FThere has also been a drop in legal
OL,17,Fmigration arrivals, asylum claims and
OL,18,Fsmall boat arrivals to the UK compared
OL,19,Fto a year ago.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
