OL,3,AWhat we know about deadly Nepal-Tibet
OL,4,Afloods
OL,5,
OL,6,FNepal's foreign minister initially said
OL,7,Fan earthquake was reported on the
OL,8,FTibet-Nepal border shortly before the
OL,9,Flandslide, suggesting it may have
OL,10,Ftriggered the disaster.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
